  "id": "blizzard/sc2-map-directory",
  "displayName": "StarCraft II loose map",
  "status": "partial",
  "runtimeVariants": [
    {
      "variantId": "trusted-node",
      "entrypoint": "./modules/map/codecs/package-directory/runtime.js",
      "target": {
        "environments": [
          "node"
        ]
      },
      "executionProfile": "trusted-in-process",
      "requestedPermissionClasses": [
        "read-source",
        "write-source"
      ]
    },
    {
      "variantId": "portable",
      "entrypoint": "./modules/map/codecs/package-directory/runtime.js",
      "target": {
        "environments": [
          "browser-worker",
          "node-worker"
        ]
      },
      "executionProfile": "worker-brokered",
      "requestedPermissionClasses": [
        "read-source",
        "write-source"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Opens an explicitly mounted loose SC2Map directory and uses the same map document, world projection, preview and revision-pinned edit operations as the packed map codec.",
    "Dependency references are reported by the codec; installation-backed dependency resolution is owned by the StarCraft II workspace provider.",
    "Nested edit plans target the authored loose files; Blizzard signing and native launch remain outside this contribution."
  ],
  "spec": {
    "formatRefs": [
      {
        "formatId": "sc2-map-directory",
        "label": "StarCraft II loose map"
      }
    ],
    "roles": [
      "semantic"
    ],
    "sourceTopology": "namespace",
    "artifactStages": [
      "authored"
    ],
    "openIntents": [
      "probe",
      "inspect",
      "full",
      "export"
    ],
    "match": {},
    "probe": {
      "kind": "namespace",
      "markers": [
        "MapInfo",
        "Objects",
        "Regions",
        "t3HeightMap",
        "t3Terrain.xml"
      ],
      "maxEntries": 5,
      "maxBytes": 65536,
      "maxDepth": 1,
      "maxPathBytes": 4096
    },
    "representations": [
      {
        "id": "workspace-namespace",
        "contract": "common.archive/entry-namespace",
        "major": 1,
        "stage": "authored",
        "lossy": false
      },
      {
        "id": "map-layers",
        "contract": "common.map/layers",
        "major": 1,
        "stage": "authored",
        "lossy": false
      }
    ],
    "fidelityEvidence": [
      {
        "formatId": "sc2-map-directory",
        "representationId": "map-layers",
        "claim": {
          "roundTrip": "semantic",
          "preservesUnknownData": true,
          "notes": [
            "A layer write changes only the written samples of t3HeightMap, t3SyncCliffLevel or t3SyncPathingInfo; the header, every untouched cell, the other fields of a height cell (adjustment, mask) and trailing bytes keep their bytes, the host commits a folder map's plan, the map reopens with the written samples, and undo restores the original (modules/map/test/sc2-map-layer-window.test.ts).",
            "Object, region and reference edits keep untouched XML bytes and unknown attributes (test/sc2-map-world-writer.test.ts); a region shape the writer normalizes reports preservesUnknownData false and is not covered.",
            "t3SyncHeightMap is not recomputed after a height write; the plan says so with the warning blizzard/sc2-map-sync-height-not-updated."
          ]
        },
        "evidenceId": "sc2-map-layer-window-v1",
        "corpusId": "modkit-extensions-blizzard/starcraft2/modules/map/test/sc2-map-layer-window.test.ts",
        "corpusDigest": "none:proof-suite",
        "conformanceProfile": "modkit/codec-contribution-v1",
        "optionsFingerprint": "options:none",
        "inputClass": "sc2-map-grid-documents",
        "provenAt": "2026-09-26T00:00:00Z"
      }
    ],
